ask(c,'Why can changing payload motivate retuning or adapting servo gains?', ['The effective joint dynamics change, affecting oscillation, tracking and settling','Payload changes the number of joints from four to six','Payload changes the encoder bit depth automatically','Payload makes feedback unnecessary at sufficiently high mass'],['Gain choices interact with the plant dynamics.','Adding load does not add kinematic joints.','Encoder resolution is a hardware property.','Larger loads do not remove the need for control feedback.'],difficulty='medium')
